      "side": 1,
      "message": "If this does use a known/static file name it may be a good idea to stat() the path first and do some extra checks before opening:\n\n- S_ISREG(stat.st_mode) \u003d\u003d 1 (only regular files)\n- stat.st_nlink \u003d\u003d 1 (only one link, itself)\n\nYou could get even more paranoid and stat() again after opening to ensure that st_ino and st_uid matches what was checked before.",
